BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thedirt": "https://thedirt.online/event/an-evening-with-tyler-merritt/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thedirt
X-SOURCE:The Dirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T220000
DTSTAMP:20260825T022550Z
CREATED:20260825T022550Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260825T022550Z
UID:10082455-1790362800-1790373600@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:An Evening with Tyler Merritt
DESCRIPTION:Join Tyler for an amazing evening of connection that will encourage your heart and remind you that Hope really does change everything \nHOPE: This Changes Everything Tour\nAn Evening with Tyler Merritt\nWhat if hope isn’t something you wait for… but something you choose? \nIn a time when division feels louder than connection and fear often overshadows possibility\, Hope: This Changes Everything offers something different—an evening that will make you laugh\, reflect\, and leave believing that even small acts of hope can change the world around us. \nJoin bestselling author\, actor\, activist\, and beloved storyteller Tyler Merritt for a one-of-a-kind live experience filled with unforgettable stories\, humor\, music\, heartfelt conversation\, and practical encouragement. With his signature authenticity\, Tyler invites audiences to rediscover what connects us\, challenges us\, and ultimately gives us reason to hope. \nWhether you’re navigating a difficult season\, looking for inspiration\, or simply longing for a night that leaves your heart a little lighter\, this event is for you. \nYour evening includes: \nAn unforgettable evening with Tyler Merritt\nA post-event book signing\nAudience Q&A\nMusic woven throughout the experience\nPersonal stories that will make you laugh\, cry\, and think\nNo matter your background\, beliefs\, or where you find yourself on life’s journey\, you’ll be welcomed into a space where compassion\, curiosity\, and hope take center stage. \nBring your friends. Bring your family. Bring someone who could use a little hope. \nYou’ll leave reminded that while one person may not be able to change everything\, each of us has the power to change something—and sometimes\, that’s exactly how everything begins to change. \nHope starts here.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/an-evening-with-tyler-merritt/
LOCATION:Davis Veterans Memorial Theatre\, 203 E. 14th Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Books & Talks
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/tyler-merritt.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Avid Reader":MAILTO:avidreaderbooks@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
