SUMMARY:Aladdin Jr
DESCRIPTION:Based on the iconic animated film\, with an Academy Award-winning score by Alan Menken\, Howard Ashman and Tim Rice\, Disney’s Aladdin Jr. is sure to send audiences soaring on a flying carpet ride filled with romance and adventure. \nWhen the street urchin\, Aladdin\, vies for the attention of the beautiful princess\, Jasmine\, he uses a genie’s magic power to become a prince in order to marry her. Iago\, Jafar\, the Genie and more are here in Disney’s Aladdin JR.\, a musical adventure filled with magic\, mayhem and the power of love. \nRecommended for all ages
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/aladdin-jr/2026-09-26/
