CREATED:20260820T044224Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260824T000004Z
UID:10081061-1790445600-1790454600@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Art Auction Party
DESCRIPTION:Art Auction Party: Saturday\, September 26\, 6-8:30 PM\nTickets: $45 Pence Members/$50 Non-Members/$55 day of event\nJoin us for our Art Auction party and enjoy delicious food by Dos Coyotes Border Café and Nugget Markets\, fine wines by Turkovich Family Wines\, live samba and bossa nova music by Boca do Rio\, themed gift baskets to win\, and the bidding finale! Event tickets are available late August online at bit.ly/penceartauction or at the Pence. Bring your cell phone to bid! \nWant to view the Art Auction ahead of time? You can preview this spectacular display of art in person at the Pence Gallery from September 5th-26th\, and online for silent auction bidding at bit.ly/penceartauction. Bidding opens online at midnight on September 5th and closes at 8 PM PST on September 26th. It’s easy to register & free to bid! \nEvent Sponsors\nThe Davis CPA\, Nancy Roe\, The Dirt/Media Sponsor\, MAK Design + Build\, Pam Marrone & Michael Rogers\, Chris Corbett Design\, Fidelity Insurance Service\, Carbahal & Company\, First Northern Bank\, Yolo Federal Credit Union\, Blake’s Heating and Air\, Scott Motley/Merrill Lynch\, Yvonne Clinton\, DeMasi Group at Echelon Real Estate\, Fred and Mary Bliss\, Brooks Painting\, Andrew Dowling\, POMESCIKOVA Positive Design\, Hollie Malamud & Chris Kelsch\, Bullseye Leak Detection\, Yolo County Supervisor Sheila Allen\, Davis Chamber of Commerce\, The Artery\, Picasso Hair Salon
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/art-auction-party/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AA-2026-postcard-png-copy.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
