DESCRIPTION:Please feel free to join us for our Pre-Grad/Law Application W
 orkspace! What do we mean by "workspace"? It's a dedicated time and space 
 for you to focus on your graduate or law school applications (especially y
 our essays) with the added benefit of having a pre-grad/law advisor availa
 ble for guidance and feedback. Feel free to come and go as you need. Just 
 bring your laptop\, snacks\, and anything else that helps you stay product
 ive. We’re here to support you as you make progress on your applications
 !
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909152
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
