X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-12-09/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Davis Farmers Market – Wednesday Evenings (50th Anniversary Year
 )
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261209T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261209T180000
UID:10002140-1796828400-1796839200@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Farmers Market continues every Wednesday in Central 
 Park with new fall hours! \nBeginning Wednesday\, September 2\, the Wednes
 day market will be open from 3:00–6:00 PM\, replacing the extended 4:00
 –8:00 PM Picnic in the Park hours. \nStop by to shop for fresh\, locally
  grown produce\, artisan goods\, prepared foods and other market favorites
  from local farmers and vendors. It’s a great opportunity to stock up fo
 r the week\, meet up with friends\, support local growers and food makers\
 , and enjoy a beautiful afternoon in Central Park. \nThe Davis Farmers Mar
 ket is celebrating its 50th Anniversary in 2026\, marking five decades of 
 bringing fresh food\, local farmers and the Davis community together. \nWe
 dnesday Market Details: \n\nWednesdays from 3:00–6:00 PM\nCentral Park i
 n Downtown Davis\nFresh\, seasonal produce\nArtisan goods and prepared foo
 ds\nLocal farmers and food makers\nFamily-friendly and open to everyone\n\
 nFree to attend – shop local and enjoy your Wednesday afternoon at the D
 avis Farmers Market!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-year-round-fresh-
 local-in-central-park-50th-anniversary-year-2-3-2/2026-12-09/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
